  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a20105d88834d764380d6090e8c10179, type: 3}
  m_Name: Test Record 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Test 1
  content: 'Don''t say, "It''s too late to begin again"

    I keep looping back
    to the very end

    Knees sinking deeper but I''ll revive

    All of the
    pain brings me back online

    The wolves at the front door welcome them in

    There''s
    tales of a hero beneath your skin

    This time around, yeah, I may fall

    But
    no doubt in your mind you have my all'
